  Hypothesis SP64 : bv_unsigned sp mod 64 = R.
  Hypothesis FR : 0x684000 <= bv_unsigned Fb <= 0x7fffff800000.
  Hypothesis F64 : bv_unsigned Fb mod 64 = 0.
  Hypothesis DJ : bv_unsigned Fb + 64 <= bv_unsigned sp - 6144.
  Hypothesis INM : bv_unsigned Fb + 72 <= 0x7fff8000 \/ 0x10007fff8000 <= bv_unsigned Fb.
